Error [jet.UseWhileWriteActive]: `node.direct` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> tests/ui/projected_write_window_overlap.jet:11:29
    |
 11 |     merge(node.direct, node.direct)
    |                             ^^^^^^
 Why: While something is being changed through a write parameter, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass `node.direct` only once, or copy first with `node.direct.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
